<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Kyung Dong City Gas January IPO approved.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Kyung Dong City Gas January IPO approved.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Securities and Exchange Commission on Friday approved Kyung Dong City Gas Co Ltd's initial public offering (IPO) of 720,000 new shares in January, the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>The stock will be offered on January 20-21 at a subscription price of 29,000 won per share. It will start publicly trading in early March, the commission said.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
